# Stain_Blood.obj -- procedurally generated placeholder (no texture on
# hand, same reasoning as Crate/Ivy -- see stainBlood.h). Flat splatter
# shape lying on the floor (local Y=0.01, a hair above the floor mesh to
# avoid z-fighting): one central splat blob plus a handful of small
# detached droplet triangles scattered around it.
# Every face vertex is written as v/vt/vn (this engine's OBJ loader
# (modelRenderer.cpp) always expects the full triplet and does not
# tolerate a bare vertex-only index).
mtllib Stain_Blood.mtl
usemtl BloodStain
